WEBVTT

25:02.569 --> 25:04.821
I wonder if they'd find you
before the wolves did.

25:04.946 --> 25:06.239
(DOOR OPENS)

25:09.618 --> 25:11.620
What are you looking at, half man?

25:11.745 --> 25:14.289
I'm looking at you.

25:15.373 --> 25:19.544
Yes. You've got an interesting face.

25:20.629 --> 25:23.715
Hmm, very distinctive faces.

25:23.840 --> 25:25.425
All of you.

25:25.550 --> 25:27.677
And what do you care about our faces?

25:27.803 --> 25:29.554
It's just...

25:29.679 --> 25:33.642
I think they would look marvelous
decorating spikes in King's Landing.
